("This potential tax liability is commonly called a student loan tax bomb. Borrowers who want to eliminate debt balances through repayment instead of awaiting a taxable discharge can review methods in our guide on","This potential tax liability is called the student loan tax bomb. Borrowers who want to pay down a balance before any discharge can read our guide on"),
("Borrowers must review their specific loan documents and program terms to determine whether their work arrangement meets these statutory criteria.","Check whether your program is one that qualifies under Section 108(f)(1), using your loan documents, your servicer, or the IRS."),
